# REQUIRES: python-api, cuda
# leapfrog-langevin-reference.test on a GPU: one leapfrog step of Langevin
# dynamics with constraints against a NumPy reference of the documented
# step (#285), in double and in mixed precision.
# Inputs/leapfrog_langevin_reference.py.
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/leapfrog_langevin_reference.py %S/Inputs %mdrt GPU Double | FileCheck %s -DMODE=Double
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/leapfrog_langevin_reference.py %S/Inputs %mdrt GPU Mixed | FileCheck %s -DMODE=Mixed
# CHECK: GPU [[MODE]] plain step: positions within {{.*}} of the documented step; {{.*}}: ok
# CHECK: GPU [[MODE]] step of energy: positions within {{.*}} of the documented step; {{.*}}: ok
